{"user": "I don't understand why a move is not legal?", "user_ts": "2026-08-05T13:38:50.792953+00:00", "assistant": "A move is legal only if the square is **empty** and placing there would trap at least one straight line of White discs between your new Black disc and an existing Black disc.\n\nHere there are **no empty squares left** \u2014 the board is full. So Black has **no legal moves**, and White has none either. That\u2019s why the game is over.\n\nFinal score by discs: **Black 21, White 43**.", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-05T13:38:52.030098+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-05T13:38:53.584043+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Knowledge Deficit Question"], "consensus": ["Knowledge Deficit Question"], "votes": {"Knowledge Deficit Question": 3}, "confidence": {"Knowledge Deficit Question": 1.0}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Knowledge Deficit Question"], "sonnet": ["Knowledge Deficit Question"], "llama": ["Knowledge Deficit Question"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant": {"final": ["Direct Instruction"], "consensus": ["Direct Instruction"], "votes": {"Direct Instruction": 3}, "confidence": {"Direct Instruction": 1.0}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Direct Instruction"], "llama": ["Direct Instruction"], "sonnet": ["Direct Instruction"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["Board Report", "General Principle"], "consensus": ["Board Report", "General Principle"], "votes": {"Board Report": 3, "General Principle": 3, "Local Justification": 1}, "confidence": {"Board Report": 1.0, "General Principle": 1.0, "Local Justification": 0.3333333333333333}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Board Report", "General Principle"], "sonnet": ["Board Report", "Local Justification", "General Principle"], "llama": ["Board Report", "General Principle"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_re